     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">El jueves, 10 de agosto de 2023 a las 19:08:36 UTC+2, Vincent van Hees escribió:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Hi Andrea,</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Did you read our tutorial: <span><a rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/readmyacccsv.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/readmyacccsv.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489625557000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2QRDj-IPA1jT1f3W71MY3N\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/readmyacccsv.html</a></span></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Further if you run into issues then make an effort to make your question as clear as possible by providing:</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><ul><li><span>Detailed description of what you did to produce the error, ideally in a way that someone else can reproduce it</span></li><li><span>Detailed description of what you tried to investigate the problem.</span></li></ul><div><span><br></span></div><div><span>Thanks, </span></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span>Vincent</span></div></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><div><div><br></div></div></div><div>\r\n        ------- Original Message -------</div><div><br>\r\n        On Thursday, August 10th, 2023 at 10:48 AM, Andrea Aizpurua &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">aizpuru...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br><br>\r\n        </div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n            <span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Hi!, I am working with FirstBeat accelerometer. This accelerometer gives a csv with 5 columns: local_time, timestamp, x, y, z. I am triying to apply GGIR to one csv file with this characteristics but in part 3 I receive the error: In readChar(con, 5L, useBytes = TRUE) : cannot open compressed file &#39;F:/accelerometerResults//</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">output_sale/meta/basic/meta_</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">NA&#39;, probable reason &#39;No such file or directory&#39;. But in the part 1 and 2 only creates meta, results, meta/basic, results/QC but they are empty.  </span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Thank you :)</div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;R package GGIR&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\">RpackageGGIR...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/RpackageGGIR/124831cc-33ef-44a2-b890-2a9e40e0e96cn%40googlegroups.com\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/RpackageGGIR/124831cc-33ef-44a2-b890-2a9e40e0e96cn%2540googlegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489625557000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0yEWoTLrXCnA-mkXpkbsJG\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/RpackageGGIR/124831cc-33ef-44a2-b890-2a9e40