     "<div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-weight:400\">Hi Andrea,</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-weight:400\">It seems your acceleration values are not in &quot;bit&quot; but in &quot;mg&quot;.</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-weight:400\">Something seems to be going wrong with the outputdir definition:</span></div><div><span style=\"display:inline!important;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-weight:400\">&#39;F:/accelerometerResults//output_sale/meta/basic/meta_NA</span><br></div><div><span style=\"display:inline!important;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-weight:400\">make sure it does not end with /</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-weight:400\">Also try shortening datadir value by just the folder path and make sure the folder does not include any non-accelerometer files. </span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"line-height:normal;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400\">Further, make sure outputdir &quot;D:/&quot; exists.</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-weight:400\">Best,</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:normal;font-weight:400\">Vincent</span></div><div><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(107,107,107)\">Dr. Vincent van Hees | Independent consultant | </span><a title=\"https://accelting.com/\" href=\"https://accelting.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://accelting.com/&am